---
manual: edit_box.change_on_type_and_delete
lines: [3017, 3019]
testability: interactive
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $seen = []
  @box = edit_box { $seen << @box.text }
end
----------- test code
click_on edit_box
assert_empty $seen, "focusing the box is not a change"

press_key "a"
press_key "b"
press_key "c"
assert_equal %w[a ab abc], $seen, "the block runs every time someone types into the box"
